3 -> [What needs to be done after initiating priority designation?]
After initiating the priority designation, the next step in the prioritization process is to propose the priority designation. This involves formally suggesting the priority level for the case or issue based on the information gathered and evaluated during the progression of information gathering. The proposal is then reviewed and finalized to ensure that the priority designation is appropriate and aligns with the necessary criteria and regulations.

