SEPTEMBER

2 -> [To which account the contribution to provident fund and family pension fund are charged based on section (G)?]
The contribution to the provident fund and family pension fund is charged to the profit & loss account based on section (G).

3 -> [What is the society name?]
American Society of Biological Chemists

