2 -> [Which mechanism is used to lift the insert out of the shell?]
The suction cup mechanism is used to lift the insert out of the shell. This is achieved by placing the three tips of the AB extractor into any three scallops on the face of the Pinnacle shell and applying thumb pressure on the lever. The resulting vibration releases the taper lock between the Ultamet insert and the Pinnacle shell, allowing the insert to be lifted out by the suction cup mechanism.

