0 -> [Which color claim form needs to used if you get sick/ disabled after being unemployed for more than 4 weeks?]
If you get sick or disabled after being unemployed for more than 4 weeks, you need to use the blue claim form. This form is specifically for situations where the disability occurs after a period of unemployment exceeding 4 weeks.

1 -> [What should be affixed on the form before mailing?]
EMPLOYEE'S CLAIM FOR BENEFITS

2 -> [If you cannot sign the claim form, then who can sign on your behalf?]
An authorized representative of the claimant can sign on their behalf. It is important to ensure that the representative has the legal authority to act on the claimant's behalf, which may involve providing documentation such as a power of attorney.

3 -> [How many instructions (main points) are there on the form?]
3

