0 -> [After what step is the ASET ( age, sex, ethnicity, type) Tacker?]
The ASET (Age, Sex, Ethnicity, Type) Tracker step follows the "Consumption" step in the questionnaire. Here is the sequence leading up to the ASET Tracker:

1. HH Census
2. Consumption
3. Usual Brand
4. Current Brand
5. Purchase Patterns
6. ASET Tracker

So, the ASET Tracker is placed after the "Purchase Patterns" step.

1 -> [Which month was the meeting held?]
SEPTEMBER

2 -> [To which account the contribution to provident fund and family pension fund are charged based on section (G)?]
The contribution to the provident fund and family pension fund are charged to the profit & loss account as incurred.

3 -> [What is the society name?]
American Society of Biological Chemists

